    "detailed_description": "Hello! I started creating this puzzle at the request of my girlfriend))) The first version was liked by my friends and I decided to run it in Steam. The gameplay is very simple - rearrange the matches so that you get mathematical equality, be smart, collect bonuses, open hidden levels and much more.<br><br>Key Features:<br>- The game has more than 100 levels of varying difficulty;<br>- Each level has at least one solution, but you can find your own and you will be awarded;<br>- Bonus levels for non-standard passing;<br>- You can use a fire extinguisher and other auxiliary tools;<br>- For skillful passage you can get items of Steam inventory;<br>- In the near future, new game elements and levels will be added;<br><br>If you like the game, I will make updates, new levels, trading cards and more. The price is symbolic - buy and enjoy! This is not the last project, write your wishes and ideas, we will do it!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1113950/extras/d4de0c8ff9285ac4c4219c59b6b86aee.poster.avif?t=1571379401\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1113950/extras/d4de0c8ff9285ac4c4219c59b6b86aee.webm?t=1571379401\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1113950/extras/d4de0c8ff9285ac4c4219c59b6b86aee.mp4?t=1571379401\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
    "about_the_game": "Hello! I started creating this puzzle at the request of my girlfriend))) The first version was liked by my friends and I decided to run it in Steam. The gameplay is very simple - rearrange the matches so that you get mathematical equality, be smart, collect bonuses, open hidden levels and much more.<br><br>Key Features:<br>- The game has more than 100 levels of varying difficulty;<br>- Each level has at least one solution, but you can find your own and you will be awarded;<br>- Bonus levels for non-standard passing;<br>- You can use a fire extinguisher and other auxiliary tools;<br>- For skillful passage you can get items of Steam inventory;<br>- In the near future, new game elements and levels will be added;<br><br>If you like the game, I will make updates, new levels, trading cards and more. The price is symbolic - buy and enjoy! This is not the last project, write your wishes and ideas, we will do it!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1113950/extras/d4de0c8ff9285ac4c4219c59b6b86aee.poster.avif?t=1571379401\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1113950/extras/d4de0c8ff9285ac4c4219c59b6b86aee.webm?t=1571379401\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1113950/extras/d4de0c8ff9285ac4c4219c59b6b86aee.mp4?t=1571379401\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
